            <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Extend your system’s lifespan through regular maintenance</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Keep you and your family comfortable and safe during all seasons</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div><div class=\"our-promise container my-5 mt-m-0\" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services technician behind the wheel of a Happy Home Services van\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van.jpg 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Experts in HVAC, Plumbing & Indoor Air Quality in Durham and Surrounding Areas</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">From cozy winters to cool summers, we are dedicated to providing top-notch HVAC and indoor air quality services in Durham, NC, ensuring your home remains comfortable and healthy throughout the year. Our expert technicians specialize in a full range of HVAC services, from installation and repairs to routine maintenance, ensuring your heating and cooling systems operate efficiently no matter the season. We understand the importance of indoor air quality for your health, which is why we offer advanced solutions to remove allergens, pollutants, and humidity imbalances, giving you cleaner, fresher air. Our team is committed to delivering exceptional service with a focus on customer satisfaction, offering transparent pricing and reliable, high-quality work. Whether you need emergency HVAC repairs, an energy-efficient system upgrade, or an indoor air quality assessment, we tailor our services to meet the specific needs of your home or business. As a locally-operated company in Durham, NC, we take pride in supporting our community with personalized, top-tier HVAC and air quality services. Contact us today to experience unparalleled comfort and breathe healthier air in your home. Let us be your trusted partner for all your HVAC and indoor air quality needs!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"maintenance-financing\" class=\"container splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2468f3b8 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile w100 border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border w100\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Clamp meter on HVAC unit\" class=\"wp-image-5359\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6\">Happy Home Service VIP Club</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph\">What You Receive with Our VIP Maintenance Club:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-block-list wp-elements-8\">\n<li>Up to 25% Discount on Repairs</li>\n\n<li>Up to an additional 25% discount on parts and labor</li>\n\n<li>Same Day Service</li>\n\n<li>Triple Labor Warranty</li>\n\n<li>50% off Minimum Service Fee</li>\n\n<li>$50 Yearly Rebate</li>\n\n<li>Flexible Payment Options</li>\n\n<li>Convenient Service Reminders</li>\n\n<li>Your 13th Month Free when you join or renew your one-year plan</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/maintenance\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer.jpg\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services employee speaking on the phone with a customer\" class=\"wp-image-4758\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-employee-speaking-on-the-phone-with-a-customer-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3\">We Offer Financing!</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services proudly offers financing options through Goodleap<sup>®</sup> and GreenSky<sup>®</sup>. Financing options let you tackle necessary repairs or upgrades without draining your savings or delaying important projects. <br></p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Financing is dependent on service requirements and credit history. Some of our short- and long-term financing options include:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>0% interest</li>\n\n<li>6.99% interest</li>\n\n<li>$58/month for furnaces</li>\n\n<li>$99/month for AC/heating units</li>\n\n<li>And more!</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/financing\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span 